WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.799
Miller, we need to talk about this bloody

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.900
cat killer case.

3
00:00:08.259 --> 00:00:09.919
Not now, Watson. Dead cats?

4
00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.160
You're serious?

5
00:00:11.259 --> 00:00:12.959
I'm a detective, not pest control.

6
00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:13.839
Do your job,

7
00:00:13.939 --> 00:00:15.120
or I'll find someone who will.

8
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:16.920
Every pathologist says it's foxes.

9
00:00:17.179 --> 00:00:18.929
This is busy work, and you know it.

10
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.699
Fine. I'll follow up on the foxes.

11
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.320
I didn't come see you lightly.

12
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.280
This police deal,

13
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.810
I've learned some things.

14
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.289
It ain't what it seems,

15
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.879
and it ain't to keep the peace.

16
00:00:41.979 --> 00:00:44.179
I went to you first, before my captains,

17
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.280
before anyone,

18
00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:46.799
because if I can't convince you,

19
00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:47.899
this plan dies.

20
00:00:48.219 --> 00:00:50.518
This plan dies. We need...

21
00:00:55.289 --> 00:00:56.789
He set Joe up.

22
00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.420
We've got a bigger problem.

23
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.500
All three crews, P Block, O Crew,

24
00:01:01.619 --> 00:01:01.939
Gif Crew,

25
00:01:02.039 --> 00:01:04.280
they're moving on us right now.

26
00:01:14.739 --> 00:01:15.980
You still got that connection,

27
00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:17.730
the groundskeeper at Selfwo Park?

28
00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.880
Yeah. Why?

29
00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.180
We're not fighting them here.

30
00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.680
We take them to the stadium,

31
00:01:23.019 --> 00:01:24.369
and we show them the truth.

32
00:01:24.859 --> 00:01:25.859
All right, boss.

33
00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.560
South Norston's under siege.

34
00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.340
We move now.

35
00:01:35.379 --> 00:01:37.120
If Liam falls, we're next.

36
00:01:38.489 --> 00:01:40.599
The alliance holds, or we all burn.

37
00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:52.130
Good place for your little crew to end.

38
00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.480
I went to you first.

39
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.239
Big Joe tried to bring us together.

40
00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:04.340
Vipay chose betrayal.

41
00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.680
You recorded this?

42
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.000
Sent it to the police.

43
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:10.900
J-Joe was weak.

44
00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.689
I don't work with snitches.

45
00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:14.259
Nah. Fuck that.

46
00:02:14.699 --> 00:02:16.149
We're not following a snitch.

47
00:02:16.879 --> 00:02:18.280
This is about a recording.

48
00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.439
You're abandoning the alliance over...

49
00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.240
He snitched.

50
00:02:27.009 --> 00:02:28.180
That's the oldest fucking rule

51
00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.199
in the book.

52
00:02:29.939 --> 00:02:31.340
I'm just in Mican Bow today.

53
00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:33.520
What are we, kids?

54
00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.379
I knew you wouldn't get it. Vipa's

55
00:02:35.479 --> 00:02:36.939
a snake. He broke the code.

56
00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:38.260
But you, Vanessa?

57
00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.460
You never understood it. You're playing

58
00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.909
a game you don't belong in.

59
00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.819
Heard about the fireworks at Selfrey

60
00:02:46.919 --> 00:02:49.020
Park. Miller suspect you?

61
00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.200
Yeah. But once I submit this as evidence,

62
00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.300
it's public record.

63
00:02:53.699 --> 00:02:54.750
Miller can't do shit.

64
00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.699
Then we can focus on getting your boy out.

65
00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.620
Vipa will be back,

66
00:03:02.659 --> 00:03:04.159
more dangerous than ever.

67
00:03:05.639 --> 00:03:07.020
Thank you. And look,

68
00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.210
I don't know what Joe found out about

69
00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:09.780
the police to make him wanna pursue peace,

70
00:03:09.879 --> 00:03:11.900
but I trust him.

71
00:03:12.819 --> 00:03:13.500
What do you say?

72
00:03:13.599 --> 00:03:14.099
Friends?

73
00:03:14.199 --> 00:03:16.319
Joe's vision, peace, unity,

74
00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.460
I respect it,

75
00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:19.879
but I won't follow it. Why?

76
00:03:20.819 --> 00:03:22.569
Because I'm destined to rule, Liam,

77
00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.979
not like a snake, like a lioness.
